JAVA MAVEN + JENKINS + SONARQUBE CLOUD CI/CD PROJECT
Setup Notes, Questions, Steps, and Troubleshooting
===================================================

PROJECT GOAL
------------
Build a Java Maven application with Jenkins on AWS EC2, analyze code using
SonarQube Cloud, enforce a Quality Gate, and archive the generated JAR.

